# README media: PETAL PARADE. The GIF is the demo player's own run (real
# button presses); the power shot is staged.
shotscale 2
seed 5
game petalparade
wait 60
shot petalparade_title
botuntil state == 1 100
botplay 1500
gifstart petalparade 3 2
botplay 480
gifstop
# staged: Posy drinks a blue jar and smashes a bramble, a cross of sun tiles ahead
cheat clear
cheat saved 64
cheat score 3480
cheat counter 4
cheat posy 1 8 0
cheat put pup 2 8
cheat put pup 3 8
cheat put jar 5 8
cheat jarlevel 5 8 3
cheat put bramble 8 8
cheat put bramble 9 4
cheat put bramble 3 3
cheat put bramble 10 10
cheat look 9 4 2
cheat look 3 3 1
cheat look 10 10 3
cheat put toadstool 7 1
cheat put toadstool 1 11
cheat put pup 6 11
cheat put pup 11 2
cheat put jar 2 5
cheat put pad 4 5
cheat put pad 5 5
cheat put pad 6 5
cheat put pad 7 5
cheat put pad 8 5
cheat put pad 6 3
cheat put pad 6 4
cheat put pad 6 6
cheat put pad 6 7
wait 61
shot petalparade_power
# the moonlit garden late in a run
cheat new
cheat saved 162
botplay 900
shot petalparade_night
